{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Break free from the system and set out as Bit to escape from the tyrannic OS. Gaining your freedom, though, might not be as clear-cut as it seems\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1724490/extras/b9352c9774201f4712b4fe09a9e7711e.poster.avif?t=1763288899\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1724490/extras/b9352c9774201f4712b4fe09a9e7711e.webm?t=1763288899\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1724490/extras/b9352c9774201f4712b4fe09a9e7711e.mp4?t=1763288899\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXPLORE THE DIGITAL WORLD</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traverse the desktop, delve into the forgotten depths of the recycle bin, be immersed into game worlds (literally!) and more. You\u2019ll overcome frantic challenges, unwind with mini-games and uncover the shrouded secrets of the OS.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1724490/extras/1157118d8aef970d842b0ab1381fe0bf.poster.avif?t=1763288899\" width=640 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1724490/extras/1157118d8aef970d842b0ab1381fe0bf.webm?t=1763288899\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1724490/extras/1157118d8aef970d842b0ab1381fe0bf.mp4?t=1763288899\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DYNAMIC &amp; TIGHT ACTION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Platform your way through hundreds of challenges and puzzles with an expansive moveset and simple-tight controls along with various accessibility options to aid you in your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1724490/extras/6ed309e141f4d4da862375a0c66c49a8.poster.avif?t=1763288899\" width=640 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1724490/extras/6ed309e141f4d4da862375a0c66c49a8.webm?t=1763288899\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1724490/extras/6ed309e141f4d4da862375a0c66c49a8.mp4?t=1763288899\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MEET THE COLORFUL LOCALS OF THE OS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stumble into lively towns and cities and meet the colorful locals of the digital world. Some will help you along your journey, others might have more devious motives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1724490/extras/bfd21eb1be41830371d5fb12a0b54b03.poster.avif?t=1763288899\" width=640 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1724490/extras/bfd21eb1be41830371d5fb12a0b54b03.webm?t=1763288899\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1724490/extras/bfd21eb1be41830371d5fb12a0b54b03.mp4?t=1763288899\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BE CAREFUL WHAT YOU WISH FOR</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ll need to make several tough decisions along the way that could affect you, the friends you\u2019ve made and even the whole digital world. </p><